    "主页": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Home"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主页"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从“%@”中提取。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Extracting from “%@”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从“%@”中提取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从压缩包中打开或拷贝的文件会先提取到缓存，其他应用打开的、剪贴板里的都是这份文件，所以不在关闭预览时删除，而是在后台服务启动时回收超过时限的部分。立即清理后，仍在其他应用中打开的这类文件可能无法保存。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Files opened or copied from an archive are first extracted to this cache. Other apps and the clipboard use these copies, so they aren’t deleted when the preview closes; instead, the background service removes expired ones when it starts. After clearing, such files still open in other apps may fail to save."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从压缩包中打开或拷贝的文件会先提取到缓存，其他应用打开的、剪贴板里的都是这份文件，所以不在关闭预览时删除，而是在后台服务启动时回收超过时限的部分。立即清理后，仍在其他应用中打开的这类文件可能无法保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保留两者": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep Both"
