    "压缩包中已有同名项目。替换会移除原有的“%@”及其全部内容。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An item with this name is already in the archive. Replacing it removes the existing “%@” and everything in it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "压缩包中已有同名项目。替换会移除原有的“%@”及其全部内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "压缩包中已有同名项目。要用拖入的项目替换它吗？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An item with this name is already in the archive. Do you want to replace it with the one you’re adding?"
