    "可选。开启后可访问所有位置，不再逐项询问。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Optional. Grants access to all locations without asking for each one."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可选。开启后可访问所有位置，不再逐项询问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同一类文件有多个预览扩展时，由系统任选其一，PeekBox 可能不会生效。请在“快速查看”中停用这些扩展。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When several preview extensions handle the same kind of file, macOS picks one of them, so PeekBox may not be used. Turn these extensions off under “Quick Look”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同一类文件有多个预览扩展时，由系统任选其一，PeekBox 可能不会生效。请在“快速查看”中停用这些扩展。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
