    "在压缩包内重命名、删除或替换后，修改前的压缩包会放进废纸篓，需要时可以找回。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After renaming, deleting or replacing items in an archive, its previous version is moved to the Trash so you can recover it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在压缩包内重命名、删除或替换后，修改前的压缩包会放进废纸篓，需要时可以找回。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
