    "扩展在“系统设置 › 通用 › 登录项与扩展 › 快速查看”中启用。后台服务负责打开、拷贝、提取和移到废纸篓，只在需要时运行，空闲约 30 秒后自动退出。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enable the extensions in System Settings › General › Login Items & Extensions › Quick Look. The background service handles opening, copying, extracting and moving to Trash; it runs only when needed and quits after about 30 seconds of inactivity."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扩展在“系统设置 › 通用 › 登录项与扩展 › 快速查看”中启用。后台服务负责打开、拷贝、提取和移到废纸篓，只在需要时运行，空闲约 30 秒后自动退出。"
          }
        }
      }
